#@start bg-start
#@args --program u7 p ABCD\0377
# The Black Gate with cheats on: a ship's deed made by the debug menu (a scroll whose quality matches
# the ship's sails) and put in the backpack, the location display on (F2 L), a teleport to the pier
# beside a ship, then aboard by the sails: the party sits and the planks rise. Sailing east, south,
# west and north (each turn swings the hull), north-west up to a beach, the sails furled, the
# planks lowered (onto shallows), the Avatar up, planks raised, sails out, away east, and a save to
# slot 2 (compared byte for byte).
# Start: the save bg-newgame.scr ends with. Arguments: --program u7 p ABCD<0xFF>
